v->proc~bmix_qmr Help Graph Key Nodes of different colours represent the following: Graph Key Subroutine Subroutine Function Function Interface Interface Type Bound Procedure Type Bound Procedure Unknown Procedure Type Unknown Procedure Type Program Program This Page's Entity This Page's Entity Solid arrows point from a procedure to one which it calls. Dashed \narrows point from an interface to procedures which implement that interface.\nThis could include the module procedures in a generic interface or the\nimplementation in a submodule of an interface in a parent module. Variables Type Visibility Attributes Name Initial real(kind=pr), private :: Ge Excess Gibbs energy. real(kind=pr), private :: GeT Temperature derivative of excess Gibbs energy. real(kind=pr), private :: GeT2 Second temperature derivative of excess Gibbs energy. real(kind=pr), private :: GeTn (size(n)) Mixed temperature/mole-number derivative of excess Gibbs energy. real(kind=pr), private :: Gen (size(n)) Mole-number gradient of excess Gibbs energy. real(kind=pr), private :: Gen2 (size(n),size(n)) Mole-number Hessian of excess Gibbs energy. real(kind=pr), private :: b real(kind=pr), private :: bi (size(n)) real(kind=pr), private :: d2logBi_nbi (size(n),size(n)) real(kind=pr), private :: dbi (size(n)) real(kind=pr), private :: dbij (size(n),size(n)) real(kind=pr), private :: dlogBi_nbi (size(n)) real(kind=pr), private :: dot_n_logB_nbi real(kind=pr), private :: f Residual or scalar equation value. real(kind=pr), private :: fdi (size(n)) real(kind=pr), private :: fdij (size(n),size(n)) real(kind=pr), private :: fdit (size(n)) real(kind=pr), private :: fdt real(kind=pr), private :: fdt2 Second-order intermediate quantity used by this procedure. integer, private :: i Loop index i . integer, private :: j Loop index j . integer, private :: l Loop index l . real(kind=pr), private :: logB_nbi (size(n)) integer, private :: nc Number of components. real(kind=pr), private :: q real(kind=pr), private :: totn T