ems_groups, T, psi, dpsi_dt, dpsi_dt2) temperature_dependence interface Interface subroutine for UNIFAC models temperature dependent\nfunctions Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name class( PsiFunction ) :: self PsiFunction type variable class( Groups ) :: systems_groups Groups type variable containig all the system’s groups. See the groups_stew variable on the UNIFAC documentation. real(kind=pr), intent(in) :: T Temperature [K] real(kind=pr), intent(out), optional :: psi (:,:) real(kind=pr), intent(out), optional :: dpsi_dt (:,:) real(kind=pr), intent(out), optional :: dpsi_dt2 (:,:) Derived Types type, public, abstract :: PsiFunction UNIFAC functions abstract type Read more… Type-Bound Procedures procedure( temperature_dependence ), public, deferred :: psi type, public, extends( PsiFunction ) :: QuadraticPsi Quadratic-in-temperature interaction function used by group models. Read more… Components Type Visibility Attributes Name Initial real(kind=pr), public, allocatable :: Aij (:,:) subgroup interaction coefficients [K]. real(kind=pr), public, allocatable :: Bij (:,:) coefficients (dimensionless). real(kind=pr), public, allocatable :: Cij (:,:) coefficients [1/K]. Type-Bound Procedures procedure, public :: psi => Quadratic_temperature_dependence type, public, extends( PsiFunction ) :: UNIFACPsi Implements the original UNIFAC pair factor and its\nfirst and second temperature derivatives from the Aij matrix. Read more… Components Type Visibility Attributes Name Initial real(kind=pr), public, allocatable :: Aij (:,:) Subgroup interaction parameters [K]. Type-Bound Procedures procedure, public :: psi => UNIFAC_temperature_dependence Subroutines public  subroutine Quadratic_temperature_dependence (self, systems_groups, T, psi, dpsi_dt, dpsi_dt2) Implementation of the QuadraticPsi function: Read more… Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name class( QuadraticPsi ) :: self function class( Groups ) :: systems_groups Groups in the system real(kind=pr), intent(