ial pressure [bar], defaults to integer, intent(in), optional :: max_points Maximum number of points, defaults to 1000 real(kind=pr), intent(in), optional :: maxP Maximum pressure [bar], defaults to 2500 type( EquilibriumState ), intent(in), optional :: first_point Optional initial point; overrides the initial guess with first_point%x(2) , Vx , T , P . logical, optional :: stability_analysis If .true. , check the stability of each traced critical state (default .false. ). Return Value type( CriticalLine ) public  function critical_point (model, z0, zi, spec, S, max_iters, V0, T0, a0, P0) Calculates a single critical point of a mixture using a Newton-Raphson\nmethod. It is possible to specify different variables to be fixed with\nthe spec argument, the spec_CP variable helps when selecting the\nspecified variable. Read more… Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name class( ArModel ), intent(in) :: model Equation of state model real(kind=pr), intent(in) :: z0 (:) Molar fractions of the first fluid real(kind=pr), intent(in) :: zi (:) Molar fractions of the second fluid integer, intent(in) :: spec Specification [1:\"a\", 2:\"V\", 3:\"T\", 4:\"P\"] (use spec_CP ) real(kind=pr), intent(in) :: S Specification value: for spec_CP%a , otherwise , or integer, intent(in) :: max_iters Maximum number of iterations real(kind=pr), intent(in), optional :: V0 Initial volume [L/mol]. real(kind=pr), intent(in), optional :: T0 Initial temperature [K]. real(kind=pr), intent(in), optional :: a0 Initial value real(kind=pr), intent(in), optional :: P0 Initial Pressure [bar] Return Value type( EquilibriumState ) public  function df_critical (model, X, ns, S, z0, zi, u) Calculates the Jacobian of the critical point function F_critical . Read more… Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name class( ArModel ), intent(in) :: model Equation of state model real(kind=pr), intent(in) :: X (4) Vector of variables integer, intent(in) :: ns Position of the specification variable real(kind=pr), 