al real(kind=pr), public, allocatable :: P (:) Pressure [bar] real(kind=pr), public, allocatable :: T (:) Temperature [K] real(kind=pr), public, allocatable :: Vw (:) Volume of vapor phase w [L/mol] real(kind=pr), public, allocatable :: Vx (:) Volume of liquid phase x [L/mol] real(kind=pr), public, allocatable :: Vy (:) Volume of liquid phase y [L/mol] real(kind=pr), public, allocatable :: w1 (:) Mole fraction of component 1 in vapor phase w real(kind=pr), public, allocatable :: x1 (:) Mole fraction of component 1 in liquid phase x real(kind=pr), public, allocatable :: y1 (:) Mole fraction of component 1 in liquid phase y type, private :: LLVVarEnum Indices of the binary LLV unknown vector used by the solver. Read more… Components Type Visibility Attributes Name Initial integer, public :: T = 10 ( in K). integer, public :: Vw = 9 of vapor phase w ( in L). integer, public :: Vx = 7 of liquid phase x ( in L). integer, public :: Vy = 8 of liquid phase y ( in L). integer, public :: w1 = 5 of component-1 amount in vapor phase w. integer, public :: w2 = 6 of component-2 amount in vapor phase w. integer, public :: x1 = 1 of component-1 amount in liquid phase x. integer, public :: x2 = 2 of component-2 amount in liquid phase x. integer, public :: y1 = 3 of component-1 amount in liquid phase y. integer, public :: y2 = 4 of component-2 amount in liquid phase y. Functions public  function binary_llv_from_cep (model, cep) result(llv) Calculate the LLV line from a converged critical end point (CEP). Read more… Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name class( ArModel ), intent(in) :: model Thermodynamic model to use type( EquilibriumState ), intent(in) :: cep Converged critical end point. Return Value type( BinaryThreePhase ) Subroutines public  subroutine find_llcl (model, z0, zi, P, a, V, T) Find an initial guess for the critical L-L line of a binary mixture. Read more… Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name class( ArModel ), intent(in) :: model Thermodynamic model