routine Function Function Program Program This Page's Entity This Page's Entity Solid arrows point from a submodule to the (sub)module which it is\ndescended from. Dashed arrows point from a module or program unit to \nmodules which it uses. Functions public  function solve_system (a, b) result(x) Solve the dense linear system with LAPACK dgesv .\nThe routine expects a square nonsingular matrix; LAPACK’s status is\ncurrently not returned to the caller. Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name real(kind=pr), intent(in) :: a (size(b),size(b)) Square coefficient matrix. real(kind=pr), intent(in) :: b (:) Right-hand-side vector. Return Value real(kind=pr), (size(b)) Subroutines public  subroutine cubic_roots (parameters, real_roots, complex_roots, flag) Solve a real cubic polynomial with coefficients . Read more… Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name real(kind=pr), intent(in) :: parameters (4) Polynomial coefficients in . real(kind=pr), intent(out) :: real_roots (3) Real roots; unused entries are NaN. complex(kind=pr), intent(out) :: complex_roots (3) Reserved complex-root output; this solver currently leaves NaN sentinels. integer, intent(out) :: flag Root case: 0 repeated real roots, 1 one real plus conjugate pair, -1 three distinct real roots. public  subroutine cubic_roots_rosendo (parameters, real_roots, complex_roots, flag) Solve a cubic polynomial using the trigonometric/Cardano formulation.\nThis alternate implementation evaluates intermediate values in\nextended precision and returns real roots plus a root-case flag. Read more… Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name real(kind=pr), intent(in) :: parameters (4) Coefficients of . real(kind=pr), intent(out) :: real_roots (3) Real roots; unused entries are not populated by this routine. complex(kind=pr), intent(out) :: complex_roots (3) Present for interface compatibility; not assigned here. integer, intent(out) :: flag -1 for three real roots, 1 for one real root. public  subroutine eigen (A, eigenvalues, eigenvectors) Calculate the eigenvalues and eigenvectors of a real symmetric matrix A using LAPACK’s dsyev . The eigenvectors are stored in the columns\nof eigenvectors . The eigenvalues are stored in eigenvalues . Read more… Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name real(kind=pr), intent(inout) :: A (:,:) Symmetric matrix; overwritten by LAPACK work data. real(kind=pr), intent(out) :: eigenvalues (:) Eigenvalues in ascending order. real(kind=pr), intent(out), optional :: eigenvectors (:,:) Eigenvectors stored as columns.","tags":"","url":"module/yaeos__math_linalg.html"},{"title":"yaeos__equilibria_boundaries_phase_envelopes_pt – yaeos","text":"Pressure-temperature phase envelopes Continuation routines for two-phase and multiphase boundaries in the plane. Description The public two-phase entry point pt_envelope_2ph continues from a\nconverged saturation point at fixed overall composition. The module also\ndefines the PTEnvel2 result type and exports critical-point markers\nfound along the envelope. Examples envelope = pt_envelope_2ph ( model , z , saturation_state ) Uses yaeos__constants yaeos__equilibria_auxiliar yaeos__equilibria_boundaries_phase_envelopes_mp yaeos__math_continuation yaeos__equilibria_equilibrium_state yaeos__models_ar module~~yaeos__equilibria_boundaries_phase_envelopes_pt~~UsesGraph module~yaeos__equilibria_boundaries_phase_envelopes_pt yaeos__equilibria_boundaries_phase_envelopes_pt module~yaeos__constants yaeos__constants module~yaeos__equilibria_boundaries_phase_envelopes_pt->module~yaeos__constants module~yaeos__equilibria_auxiliar yaeos__equilibria_auxiliar module~yaeos__equilibria_boundaries_phase_envelopes_pt->module~yaeos__equilibria_auxiliar module~yaeos__equilibria_boundaries_phase_envelopes_mp yaeos__equilibria_boundaries_phase_envelopes_mp module~yaeos__equilibria_boundaries_phase_envelopes_pt->module~yaeos__equilibria_boundaries_phase_envelopes_mp module~yaeos__equilibria_equilibrium_state yaeos__equilibria_equil